    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;HackFest aims to make technology and knowledge accessible to everyone, promotes creativity and stimulates both social and economic innovation. On Saturday 10 Oktober 2026, Hackfest gives a platform to a diverse group of creative minds, hackers, inventors, designers, artists, engineers, developers and hobbyists to showcase their projects in an inspiring space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These enthusiastic makers come to Hackfest to present their creations and share their discoveries with the public. The event brings together curious people who enjoy learning and sharing their skills through lectures and workshops and working on their own projects on site. It is a place where people are amazed by installations, original do-it-yourself projects, fascinating discoveries and innovative solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

